OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStarting off mainly dry with
OL,6,Fsome brightness in the east. Otherwise
OL,7,Frather cloudy at times with showers
OL,8,Fbreaking out, these becoming fewer
OL,9,Flater in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers will die away out
OL,12,Fthis evening. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud and clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FAll parts will have a dry
OL,17,Fday with some bright or sunny spells.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
